#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: plugin.php
msgid "WPML CMS Navigation"
msgstr "WPML CMS Navigation"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: plugin.php
msgid "https://wpml.org/"
msgstr "https://wpml.org/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: plugin.php
msgid ""
"Adds CMS navigation elements to sites built with WPML | <a "
"href=\"https://wpml.org/documentation/support/cms-"
"navigation/\">Documentation</a> | <a href=\"https://wpml.org/version/wpml-"
"cms-nav-5-2-0/\">WPML CMS Navigation 5.2.0 release notes</a>"
msgstr "CMS-navigációs elemeket ad a WPML-lel készült webhelyekhez | <a href=\"https://wpml.org/documentation/support/cms-navigation/\">dokumentáció</a> | <a href=\"https://wpml.org/version/wpml-cms-nav-5-2-0/\">WPML CMS Navigation 5.2.0 kiadási megjegyzések</a>"

#. Author of the plugin
#: plugin.php
msgid "OnTheGoSystems"
msgstr "OnTheGoSystems"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: plugin.php
msgid "http://www.onthegosystems.com/"
msgstr "http://www.onthegosystems.com/"

#. translators: Name and description of the Sidebar Navigation widget, shown
#. in the WordPress widgets screen.
#: app/Presentation/Widget/NavigationWidget.php:21
#: app/Presentation/Widget/NavigationWidget.php:24
msgid "Sidebar Navigation"
msgstr "Oldalsávos navigáció"

#. translators: Default title of the menu that lists the blog categories, on
#. the CMS Navigation page and in the menu itself. Noun.
#: inc/cms-navigation-schema.php:150 inc/cms-navigation.class.php:781
#: inc/cms-navigation.class.php:784 menu/navigation.php:71
msgid "News"
msgstr "Hírek"

#. translators: Admin notice shown when WPML CMS Navigation is active but WPML
#. core is missing. %1$s: the URL of the client's wpml.org account downloads
#. page, which fills the first link. %2$s: the URL of this site's Plugins
#. screen, which fills the second link.
#: inc/cms-navigation.class.php:183
#, php-format
msgid ""
"WPML CMS Navigation is active, but it needs WPML Multilingual CMS, which is "
"not installed or not active. CMS Navigation stays off until WPML runs. "
"Download WPML from <a href=\"%1$s\">your wpml.org account</a> and activate "
"it on the <a href=\"%2$s\">Plugins screen</a>."
msgstr "A WPML CMS Navigation aktív, de szüksége van a WPML Multilingual CMS-re, amely nincs telepítve vagy nincs bekapcsolva. A CMS Navigation kikapcsolva marad, amíg a WPML nem fut. Töltse le a WPML-t a <a href=\"%1$s\">wpml.org-fiókjából</a>, és kapcsolja be a <a href=\"%2$s\">bővítmények képernyőjén</a>."

#. translators: Admin notice shown when the installed WPML core is older than
#. WPML CMS Navigation needs. %1$s: CMS Navigation's own version. %2$s: the
#. minimum WPML version it needs. %3$s: the WPML version this site runs. %4$s:
#. the URL of this site's Plugins screen, which fills the link.
#: inc/cms-navigation.class.php:204
#, php-format
msgid ""
"WPML CMS Navigation %1$s needs WPML Multilingual CMS %2$s or newer. This "
"site runs WPML %3$s, so CMS Navigation stays off until WPML is updated. "
"Update WPML on the <a href=\"%4$s\">Plugins screen</a>."
msgstr "A WPML CMS Navigation %1$s verziójához a WPML Multilingual CMS %2$s vagy újabb verziója szükséges. Ezen a webhelyen a WPML %3$s verziója fut, ezért a CMS Navigation kikapcsolva marad, amíg nem frissíti a WPML-t. Frissítse a WPML-t a <a href=\"%4$s\">bővítmények képernyőjén</a>."

#. translators: Breadcrumbs line on the front end of the site, above the list
#. of posts that carry one tag. %s: the name of the tag, shown between
#. typographic quotation marks.
#: inc/cms-navigation.class.php:715
#, php-format
msgid "Articles tagged &#8216;%s&#8217;"
msgstr "&#8222;%s&#8221; címkével ellátott bejegyzések"

#. translators: Breadcrumbs line on the front end of the site, above the
#. results of a search. %s: the words the visitor searched for.
#: inc/cms-navigation.class.php:739
#, php-format
msgid "Search for: %s"
msgstr "Keresés: %s"

#. translators: Title of the box on the post and page editing screens where
#. the navigation settings of that page are set.
#: inc/cms-navigation.class.php:1211
msgid "CMS Navigation"
msgstr "CMS navigáció"

#: inc/cms-navigation.class.php:1280
msgid "Exclude from the top navigation"
msgstr "Kizárás a felső navigációból"

#: inc/cms-navigation.class.php:1281
msgid ""
"Mini home (don't list child pages for this page in the navigation sidebar)"
msgstr "Mini kezdőlap (ne jelenítse meg ennek az oldalnak az aloldalait a navigációs oldalsávban)"

#. translators: Label of the field on the post editing screen that says which
#. section of the site the page belongs to. Noun.
#: inc/cms-navigation.class.php:1285
msgid "Section"
msgstr "Szakasz"

#. translators: Option in the section dropdown on the post editing screen: the
#. page belongs to no section.
#: inc/cms-navigation.class.php:1289
msgid "--none--"
msgstr "--nincs--"

#. translators: Link on the post editing screen that opens a field for typing
#. a new section name. Verb, imperative.
#: inc/cms-navigation.class.php:1307 inc/cms-navigation.class.php:1332
msgid "enter new"
msgstr "új megadása"

#: inc/cms-navigation.class.php:1311
msgid "Offsite page address"
msgstr "Külső oldal címe"

#. translators: Link on the post editing screen that closes the field for a
#. new section name without keeping it. Verb, imperative, lower case in the
#. source.
#: inc/cms-navigation.class.php:1337
msgid "cancel"
msgstr "mégse"

#. translators: Link next to WPML CMS Navigation on the WordPress plugins
#. screen: it opens the settings page. Verb, imperative.
#: inc/cms-navigation.class.php:1429
msgid "Configure"
msgstr "Beállítás"

#: menu/navigation.php:8
msgid "The cache has been cleared."
msgstr "A gyorsítótár kiürítve."

#: menu/navigation.php:11
msgid "Setup WPML CMS Navigation"
msgstr "A WPML CMS Navigation beállítása"

#. translators: Heading of the settings section on the CMS Navigation page,
#. and the name of that page in the WPML menu. Noun.
#: menu/navigation.php:14
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "Navigáció"

#: menu/navigation.php:16
msgid ""
"Out-of-the-box support for full CMS navigation in your WordPress site "
"including drop down menus, breadcrumbs trail and sidebar navigation."
msgstr "Azonnal használható, teljes körű támogatás a CMS-navigációhoz a WordPress-webhelyén, beleértve a legördülő menüket, a breadcrumb-útvonalat és az oldalsávos navigációt."

#. translators: Heading above the settings form on the CMS Navigation page.
#: menu/navigation.php:20
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Beállítások"

#. translators: Label of the setting on the CMS Navigation page that says in
#. which sequence pages are listed. Noun phrase, not an instruction to order
#. pages.
#: menu/navigation.php:27 menu/navigation.php:73
msgid "Page order"
msgstr "Oldalsorrend"

#. translators: Option in the page order dropdown on the CMS Navigation page:
#. the sequence set by hand in each page. Noun phrase.
#: menu/navigation.php:35
msgid "Menu order"
msgstr "Menüsorrend"

#. translators: Option in the page order dropdown on the CMS Navigation page:
#. pages listed by name from A to Z. Adverb.
#: menu/navigation.php:41
msgid "Alphabetically"
msgstr "Betűrendben"

#. translators: Option in the page order dropdown on the CMS Navigation page:
#. pages listed by the date they were created. Noun phrase.
#: menu/navigation.php:47
msgid "Creation time"
msgstr "Létrehozás ideje"

#: menu/navigation.php:52
msgid "Blog posts menu"
msgstr "Blogbejegyzések menüje"

#: menu/navigation.php:58
msgid "Show blog posts menu"
msgstr "Blogbejegyzések menüjének megjelenítése"

#: menu/navigation.php:68
msgid "Categories menu title"
msgstr "Kategóriamenü címe"

#: menu/navigation.php:77
msgid "Select what items to display for the blog menu:"
msgstr "Válassza ki, milyen elemek jelenjenek meg a blog menüben:"

#. translators: Label of the radio button on the CMS Navigation page: the blog
#. menu lists the post categories. Noun, plural.
#: menu/navigation.php:83
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "Kategóriák"

#. translators: Label of the radio button on the CMS Navigation page: the blog
#. menu lists the newest posts. Noun phrase, plural.
#: menu/navigation.php:89
msgid "Recent posts"
msgstr "Legutóbbi bejegyzések"

#. translators: Label of the radio button on the CMS Navigation page: the blog
#. menu lists nothing.
#: menu/navigation.php:95
msgid "Nothing"
msgstr "Semmi"

#: menu/navigation.php:101
msgid "Sidebar pages menu"
msgstr "Oldalsáv oldalmenüje"

#. translators: Label of the field on the CMS Navigation page that holds the
#. HTML put before each sidebar heading.
#: menu/navigation.php:105
msgid "Heading start"
msgstr "Címsor kezdete"

#. translators: Label of the field on the CMS Navigation page that holds the
#. HTML put after each sidebar heading.
#: menu/navigation.php:108
msgid "Heading end"
msgstr "Címsor vége"

#. translators: Label of the field on the CMS Navigation page that holds the
#. character shown between the steps of a breadcrumbs trail.
#: menu/navigation.php:116
msgid "Breadcrumbs separator"
msgstr "Breadcrumb-elválasztó"

#. translators: Label of the setting on the CMS Navigation page that turns
#. caching of the navigation on or off. Noun.
#: menu/navigation.php:126
msgid "Caching"
msgstr "Gyorsítótárazás"

#: menu/navigation.php:133
msgid "Cache navigation elements for super fast performance"
msgstr "A navigációs elemek gyorsítótárazása a szupergyors teljesítményért"

#: menu/navigation.php:135
msgid "Clear cache now"
msgstr "Gyorsítótár kiürítése most"

#. translators: Button label on the CMS Navigation page that saves the
#. settings. Verb, imperative.
#: menu/navigation.php:145
msgid "Save Changes"
msgstr "Változtatások mentése"

#: menu/navigation.php:152
msgid "Instructions for adding the navigation to your theme"
msgstr "Útmutató a navigáció sablonba illesztéséhez"

#. translators: Column heading in the table of navigation elements on the CMS
#. Navigation page: the name of the element.
#: menu/navigation.php:158
msgid "Navigation element"
msgstr "Navigációs elem"

#. translators: Column heading in the table of navigation elements on the CMS
#. Navigation page: what the element does.
#: menu/navigation.php:160
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Leírás"

#: menu/navigation.php:161
msgid "HTML to add"
msgstr "Hozzáadandó HTML"

#: menu/navigation.php:162
msgid "Where to add"
msgstr "Hozzáadás helye"

#. translators: Name of a navigation element in the table on the CMS
#. Navigation page: the menu across the top of the site.
#: menu/navigation.php:168
msgid "Top navigation"
msgstr "Felső navigáció"

#: menu/navigation.php:169
msgid ""
"A list of the top level pages with drop down menus for second level menus. "
"Can optionally contain the post categories"
msgstr ""
"A legfelső szintű oldalak listája, a második szinthez legördülő menükkel. "
"Opcionálisan tartalmazhatja a bejegyzéskategóriákat."

#. translators: Name of a navigation element in the table on the CMS
#. Navigation page: the trail of links back to the home page.
#: menu/navigation.php:175
msgid "Breadcrumbs trails"
msgstr "Breadcrumb-útvonalak"

#: menu/navigation.php:176
msgid "Lists the path back to the home page"
msgstr "Felsorolja a kezdőlapra visszavezető útvonalat"

#. translators: Cell in the table of navigation elements on the CMS Navigation
#. page: the theme files where this element can be placed. Each placeholder is
#. a WordPress theme file name and stays as it is: %1$s, %2$s, %3$s, %4$s,
#. %5$s and %6$s.
#: menu/navigation.php:179
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s or %2$s, %3$s, %4$s, %5$s and %6$s"
msgstr "%1$s vagy %2$s, %3$s, %4$s, %5$s és %6$s"

#. translators: Name of a navigation element in the table on the CMS
#. Navigation page: the menu in the sidebar.
#: menu/navigation.php:183
msgid "Sidebar navigation"
msgstr "Oldalsávos navigáció"

#: menu/navigation.php:184
msgid "Local navigation tree with page siblings, parent and brothers"
msgstr ""
"Helyi navigációs fa az oldal testvéroldalaival, szülőjével és gyermekeivel"

#. translators: Note under the table of navigation elements on the CMS
#. Navigation page. %s: the address of the WordPress widgets screen, put
#. inside the opening link tag.
#: menu/navigation.php:191
#, php-format
msgid "You can also add the sidebar navigation as a <a%s>widget</a>."
msgstr "Az oldalsávos navigációt <a%s>widgetként</a> is hozzáadhatja."

#: menu/navigation.php:193
msgid ""
"To customize the appearance of the navigation elements, you will need to "
"override the styling provided in the plugin's CSS file."
msgstr ""
"A navigációs elemek megjelenésének testreszabásához felül kell írnia a "
"bővítmény CSS-fájljában meghatározott stílusokat."

#. translators: Last line of the CMS Navigation page. %s: a link to the WPML
#. documentation.
#: menu/navigation.php:214
#, php-format
msgid "Visit %s for full CSS customization information."
msgstr ""
"Látogasson el ide: %s, ahol teljes körű információt talál a CSS "
"testreszabásáról."

